{"id":"en_grandmaster-in-heiress-s-guise","title":"Grandmaster in Heiress's Guise","titleEn":"Grandmaster in Heiress's Guise","description":"Maeve Winslow, a supreme master of the Dao, fails her tribulation and is reborn as the true heiress of a wealthy family—a young woman who shares her name but whose life was swapped at birth. Confronted with her adoptive father's murderous plot and the machinations of the fake heiress, she retaliates with thunderous force, steadily stripping away the impostor's facade. Reborn a second time, she vows that anyone who wrongs her will pay a hundredfold.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/grandmaster-in-heiresss-guise/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/grandmaster-in-heiresss-guise/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Urban","One Night Stand","Face-Slap","SecretIdentity","Eastern Fantasy"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl3t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_grandmaster-in-heiress-s-guise_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl3t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_grandmaster-in-heiress-s-guise_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl3t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_grandmaster-in-heiress-s-guise_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl3t2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_grandmaster-in-heiress-s-guise_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl3t2/?